!Translation Projects In Progress
*A project on translating the [http://www.digitalkingdom.org/cvsweb/lojban/translations/drbible/|Bible] (contained in Robin Lee Powell's CVS repository, available online on CVSWeb)
*A group translation of [http://www.lojban.org/twiki|Alice in Wonderland] hosted on a TWiki
*[http://www.lojban.org/files/roadmap.html#texts|Some texts] (most of them fairly old and shortish) (found at the [http://www.lojban.org/|Lojban.org] site)
*The Tao Te Ching ((daudydjin.))
*The American Declaration of Independence ((declaration))
*A group translation of Kahlil Gibran's ((TheProphet)).

!Short Stories
*A translation of the short story ((Little Things)), by Raymond Carver
*Two translations of "The Book", by H. P. Lovecraft: ((tu'a le cukta)) (done by ((Jordan DeLong))), and ((My version of 'The Book')) (by Michael Helsem).
*Translation done by ((Jordan DeLong)) of "The man and the Snake", by Ambrose Bierce: ((le nanmu kujo'u le since))

